sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant TB as 🧪 tb_top<br/>(Testbench)
    participant REG as 🔧 reg_driver<br/>(寄存器配置)
    participant SRC as 📤 axis_video_source<br/>(激励源)
    participant DUT as 🎯 gamma_corr IP<br/>(待测模块)
    participant SNK as 📥 axis_video_sink<br/>(结果采集)

    Note over TB,DUT: 阶段一：初始化与寄存器配置

    TB->>REG: 等待复位释放
    REG->>DUT: write IMG_WIDTH = 1920
    REG->>DUT: write IMG_HEIGHT = 1080
    REG->>DUT: write IMG_FORMAT = 3 (RGB888)
    REG->>DUT: write IP_CTRL = 0x01 (使能)
    REG->>DUT: write IP_PARAM_GAMMA = 0x1600<br/>(gamma=2.2, Q8.8)

    Note over TB,SNK: 阶段二：像素流传输

    SRC->>DUT: tuser=1 (SOF 帧开始)
    loop 逐行传输 (1080行 × 1920像素)
        SRC->>DUT: tdata[0..3] (4像素并行)
        SRC->>DUT: tlast=1 (EOL 行结束)
    end

    Note over TB,SNK: 阶段三：结果输出与仿真结束

    DUT->>SNK: 流水线延迟后逐行输出 Gamma 校正结果
    SNK->>SNK: 写入 result.hex
    SNK->>TB: frame_done 脉冲
    TB->>TB: $finish 仿真结束
